# The pages.dev hostname serves the same site; keep it out of the index so
# thirstybeaches.com is the only copy Google ranks. (Preview deployments
# already get noindex from Cloudflare by default.)
https://thirsty-beaches.pages.dev/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex

# Content-Security-Policy on the PUBLIC pages only. The owner/staff pages (/trailer, /studio, /card) use inline scripts and
# handlers and are deliberately left out. 'unsafe-hashes' + the sha256 of this.media='all' lets the non-blocking font links
# (<link ... media="print" onload="this.media='all'">) keep working; no other inline script exists on these pages.
# unpkg.com = Leaflet (map), *.tile.openstreetmap.org = map tiles, tb-where = the location/signup/arcade API,
# station = order ahead, raw.githubusercontent.com = today's specials on /menu. Add a host here before using a new one.
# _headers lines are limited in length by Cloudflare (2000 chars); keep this one policy on a single line per path.
